		{
			"id": "Blasts",
			"_note": "Marketing blast list as a declarative type:index page (pipelinq-declarative-pages-round1). A row click and the built-in View open the live monitor (BlastMonitor, via rowRoute); Add opens BlastWizardDialog in the form-dialog slot: a multi-step wizard with a compliance gate (conditional advancing, an optional A/B split, template validation and a consent preflight that holds the create back pending the marketer's decision), which no declarative form expresses. Rows can be selected, as board PqNieuwsbrieven draws, and a selection downloaded.",
			"route": "/blasts",
			"type": "index",
			"title": "Newsletters",
			"slots": {
				"form-dialog": "BlastWizardDialog"
			},
			"config": {
				"register": "pipelinq",
